{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《阿爺廚房》中，李家鼎（鼎爺）曾示範炮製鮮香滿溢的「糯米蟹」。這道菜將生拆蟹膏、瑤柱絲及冬菇粒拌入黃金比例的紅白米中同蒸，鮮甜豐腴的蟹汁在高溫下滲透進飯粒，最後淋上熟油提香，海鮮甘甜與蔥油香氣交織，口感層次極度豐富。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"191fe82d-8bbf-4c67-9eb3-b38bd3aa1091.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/202617dZDfF9qr1784863066.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"191fe82d-8bbf-4c67-9eb3-b38bd3aa1091.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>糯米蟹所需材料</strong>：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">膏蟹</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">冬菇</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">瑤柱</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">糯米</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">白米</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">芫荽</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">蔥</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>糯米蟹煮食步驟</strong>：</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c02918dd-2225-4a81-9712-bb375fbe3964.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026fVknnw4WbV1784863061.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c02918dd-2225-4a81-9712-bb375fbe3964.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-27T01:18:30.288891+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}